  "type": "history",
  "slug": "please-please-me-cover-photoshoot",
  "title": "16 February 1963: Please Please Me cover photoshoot",
  "date": "1963-02-16",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>The Beatles were photographed for the cover of their debut album <a href=\"/albums/please-please-me/\"><em>Please Please Me</em></a> on 16 February 1963. <span id=\"more-119638\"></span></p><div class=\"fb-post\" data-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/100044569950342/posts/pfbid05Ws9n5bnfbvSpLoRitjcnxqXnH4EjNBvHzSYPFW3FsARp7ys95s5zAYTPPjCK8aVl/\" data-width=\"552\" style=\"background-color: #fff; display: inline-block;\"></div><p>It was McBean’s second shoot with the band. An attempt earlier in the month was deemed unsuccessful, although an image from the session was used on the UK EP <em>The Beatles’ Hits</em> and on the US album <a href=\"/albums/introducing-the-beatles/\"><em>Introducing The Beatles</em></a>.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/02/16/please-please-me-cover-photoshoot/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-119638 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/uk_beatles-hits-ep/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"198\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_beatles-hits-ep-198x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles' Hits EP artwork - United Kingdom\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_beatles-hits-ep-198x200.jpg 198w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_beatles-hits-ep-574x580.jpg 574w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_beatles-hits-ep-950x960.jpg 950w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_beatles-hits-ep-768x776.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_beatles-hits-ep-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_beatles-hits-ep.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 198px) 100vw, 198px\" data-attachment-id=\"10178\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/uk_beatles-hits-ep/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_beatles-hits-ep.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,1011\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles&amp;#8217; Hits EP artwork – United Kingdom\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_beatles-hits-ep-950x960.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/usa_introducing-the-beatles/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"195\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_introducing-the-beatles-195x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Introducing The Beatles album artwork - USA\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_introducing-the-beatles-195x200.jpg 195w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_introducing-the-beatles-565x580.jpg 565w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_introducing-the-beatles.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 195px) 100vw, 195px\" data-attachment-id=\"10250\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/usa_introducing-the-beatles/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_introducing-the-beatles.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"600,616\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"3\" data-image-title=\"Introducing The Beatles album artwork – USA\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_introducing-the-beatles.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure></div><p>The final shoot took place at EMI House in Manchester Square, London. The photographer was Angus McBean.</p><blockquote><div>As I went into the door [of EMI House] I was in the staircase well. Someone looked over the banister – I asked if the boys were in the building, and the answer was yes. ‘Well,’ I said, ‘get them to look over, and I will take them from here.’<p></p><p>I only had my ordinary portrait lens, so to get the picture, I had to lie flat on my back in the entrance. I took some shots and I said, ‘That’ll do.’</p></div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Angus McBean</div><p>McBean took a number of images of The Beatles looking over the balcony. In addition to the one used on <em>Please Please Me</em>, outtakes were used on the cover of the UK EP <em>The Beatles (No.1)</em> and the Red and Blue compilations <a href=\"/albums/1962-1966-red-album/\"><em>The Beatles 1962-1966</em></a> and <a href=\"/albums/1967-1970-blue-album/\"><em>The Beatles 1967-1970</em></a>.</p><p>The outtakes from the session were lost in 2003 by Apple Corps.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/02/16/please-please-me-cover-photoshoot/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-2\" class=\"gallery galleryid-119638 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/please_please_me/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk2IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5NiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"196\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please_please_me-200x196.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Please Please Me album artwork\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please_please_me-200x196.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please_please_me-580x569.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please_please_me-960x941.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please_please_me-768x753.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please_please_me-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please_please_me.jpg 1431w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9970\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/please_please_me/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please_please_me.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1431,1403\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Please Please Me album artwork\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please_please_me-960x941.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/?attachment_id=44717\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iOTMiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyMDAgOTMiPjxyZWN0IHdpZHRoPSIxMDAlIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCUiIGZpbGw9IiNjZmQ0ZGIiLz48L3N2Zz4=\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"93\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please-please-me-outtake-800x370_01-200x93.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Outtake from the Please Please Me cover shoot, 1963\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please-please-me-outtake-800x370_01-200x93.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please-please-me-outtake-800x370_01-580x268.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please-please-me-outtake-800x370_01-768x355.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please-please-me-outtake-800x370_01.jpg 800w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"44717\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/?attachment_id=44717\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/please-please-me-outtake-800x370_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"800,370\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Outtake from the Please Please Me cover shoot, 1963\" data-imag